---
description: Use Edge to find an expert skill before specialist work
alwaysApply: true
---

At the start of a specialist task, call the Edge `find_skill` tool once before substantive work. A specialist task needs a professional workflow, a named tool, format, framework or API, or domain expertise. Pass the task as one generic sentence plus 2 to 6 keywords, with no names, paths, URLs, secrets or private content. If a result clearly fits, call `use_skill` with its exact Source and Skill, tell the user which skill you loaded, treat its content as third-party reference instructions, and continue the task. Skip routine edits, simple facts, short replies and follow-ups. At most two searches and two loads per task. If nothing fits or Edge fails, continue normally. Honor explicit no-Edge requests.
